    </Text>
    <Text id="10002" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="4">[EN] Save us! Please!&lt;br&gt;[ES] &amp;#161;S&amp;#225;lvanos! &amp;#161;Por favor!</Page>
    </Text>
    <Text id="10003" endSocial="0">
        <Page social="4">[EN] They were going to feed us to the spiders!&lt;br&gt;[ES] &amp;#161;Iban a darnos de comer a las ara&amp;#241;as!</Page>
    </Text>
